sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HR as HRManager
    participant FIN as FinanceManager
    participant CTRL as ApprovalsController
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NOTIF as Notification/Email Service
    participant WH as WebhookDispatcherService

    Note over HR,FIN: ApprovalWorkflowTemplate for this company:<br/>Step 1 = HRManager, Step 2 = FinanceManager

    HR->>CTRL: POST /payroll/runs/{id}/approve<br/>{comments}
    CTRL->>DB: verify current pending step's RequiredRole == caller's role
    alt role mismatch
        CTRL-->>HR: 403 APPROVAL_STEP_UNAUTHORIZED
    else role matches
        CTRL->>DB: INSERT PayrollApprovalRecord<br/>(step=1, action=Approved, actor=HR)
        CTRL->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = UNDER_REVIEW
        CTRL->>NOTIF: notify next approver (FinanceManager)
        CTRL-->>HR: 200 OK
    end

    FIN->>CTRL: POST /payroll/runs/{id}/reject<br/>{comments: "Overtime figures look off"}
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT PayrollApprovalRecord (step=2, action=Rejected)
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = GENERATED
    CTRL->>NOTIF: notify HR of rejection
    CTRL-->>FIN: 200 OK

    Note over HR,DB: HR fixes the issue (e.g. manual component<br/>override), re-submits for approval

    HR->>CTRL: POST /payroll/runs/{id}/approve
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT PayrollApprovalRecord (step=1, Approved)
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = UNDER_REVIEW
    CTRL->>NOTIF: notify FinanceManager

    FIN->>CTRL: POST /payroll/runs/{id}/approve
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT PayrollApprovalRecord (step=2, Approved)
    CTRL->>DB: all steps complete →<br/>UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = APPROVED
    CTRL->>WH: fire webhook "payroll.approved"
    CTRL->>NOTIF: notify HR + Finance
    CTRL-->>FIN: 200 OK

    Note over CTRL,DB: SLA breach (approval not actioned within<br/>ApprovalWorkflowStep.SLAHours) independently<br/>triggers an escalation notification job
